        "next_who": "Bo",
        "answer": "It means your car won't visit the bay without you.",
        "decoys": [
          "It means you parked too far out.",
          "It's a kind of street sweeping.",
          "It means you need a permit."
        ],
        "reveal_emoji": "🛞"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sweeping day",
        "setting": "There's a ticket on the windshield.",
        "cast": [
          {
            "name": "Tess",
            "shape": "tall",
            "role": "secondary"
          },
          {
            "name": "Bo",
            "shape": "round",
            "role": "primary"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "Tess",
            "text": "Why is there a ticket on my car?"
          },
          {
            "who": "Bo",
            "text": "Tuesday is street sweeping."
          },
          {
            "who": "Tess",
            "text": "But it's Tuesday... oh."
          },
          {
            "who": "Bo",
            "text": "Welcome to the neighborhood."
          }
        ],
        "next_who": "Tess",
        "answer": "So that's what the giant broom truck was.",
        "decoys": [
          "I'll frame it as a souvenir.",
          "Can I park in your garage?",
          "Do you know a good bakery?"
        ],
        "reveal_emoji": "🧹"
      },
      {
        "title": "Uphill start",
        "setting": "A new neighbor offers to help.",
        "cast": [
          {
            "name": "Milo",
            "shape": "star",
            "role": "accent"
          },
          {
            "name": "Tess",
            "shape": "tall",
            "role": "secondary"
          },
          {
            "name": "Bo",
            "shape": "round",
            "role": "primary"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "Milo",
            "text": "Need help? I'm Milo, from 4B."
          },
          {
            "who": "Tess",
            "text": "My car keeps rolling back on the hill."
          },
          {
            "who": "Milo",
            "text": "Handbrake, gas, then let go slowly."
          },
          {
            "who": "Tess",
            "text": "And if that doesn't work?"
          }
        ],
        "next_who": "Milo",
        "answer": "Then we push, and Bo films it.",
        "decoys": [
          "Then you call a tow truck.",
          "Then you sell the car.",
          "Then you try a flatter street."
        ],
        "reveal_emoji": "🎬"
      },
      {
        "title": "The perfect spot",
        "setting": "A spot opens up right out front.",
        "cast": [
          {
            "name": "Bo",
            "shape": "round",
            "role": "primary"
          },
          {
            "name": "Milo",
            "shape": "star",
            "role": "accent"
          },
          {
            "name": "Tess",
            "shape": "tall",
            "role": "secondary"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "Bo",
            "text": "Someone's leaving the spot out front!"
          },
          {
            "who": "Milo",
            "text": "I'll guard it with my body."
          },
          {
            "who": "Tess",
            "text": "I'm three blocks away. Hold on!"
          },
          {
            "who": "Milo",
            "text": "A van is circling. Hurry!"
          }
        ],
        "next_who": "Tess",
        "answer": "Lie down and look like a traffic cone!",
        "decoys": [
          "Let them have it. I'll take the bus.",
          "Ask them to come back later.",
          "I'll just park in the driveway."
        ],
        "reveal_emoji": "🚧"
      },
      {
        "title": "Housewarming",
        "setting": "Tess is throwing a party.",
        "cast": [
          {
            "name": "Tess",
            "shape": "tall",
            "role": "secondary"
          },
          {
            "name": "Bo",
            "shape": "round",
            "role": "primary"
          },
          {
            "name": "Milo",
            "shape": "star",
            "role": "accent"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "Tess",
            "text": "Thanks for all the parking help, you two."
          },
          {
            "who": "Bo",
            "text": "That's what neighbors are for."
          },
          {
            "who": "Milo",
            "text": "So, about your housewarming party..."
